        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The graph shows electricity production (in terawatt hours) in France between 1980 and 2012. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MPYMdP1Qho3MCex81NnlFrAKgEb\"><em><strong>The graph shows electricity production (in terawatt hours) in France between 1980 and 2012.&nbsp;Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>&nbsp;IELTS Writing Task 1 - Electricity production in France by source: 1980 - 2012</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CYVsdh3adoPqlLxBlWcl4gUVgwd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-line-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Giới thiệu dạng Line Graphs</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WzbldxsHvoEmSdxHZSalPqZUg4b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i <em>Electricity production in France by source: 1980 - 2012</em> y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về lượng điện được sản xuất từ bốn nguồn kh&aacute;c nhau ở Ph&aacute;p từ năm 1980 đến năm 2012.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLFYdUG36o4o85xAOPBlI161gNd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span><strong> </strong>trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UEs9dlyx2okrTPxmScBl9NDNgwh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề <em>Electricity production in France by source: 1980 - 2012</em> với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: lượng điện được sản xuất - bốn nguồn năng lượng - Ph&aacute;p - từ năm 1980 đến 2012.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SMCAdCHAAo2jQNxu5Fplz84fgmb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Line Graphs</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong> </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-line\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng LINE</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BPLHdZ1AWonL9Zx1HAklrflQgAd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrEfdeA32oruHJxpv0CltBnPg7d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FCkCdAPs9oUNGVxxTwhlgylYgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UnG2dXTj8oL2X8xuX3Rlt6d3g6b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>Bốn nguồn c&oacute; xu hướng kh&aacute;c nhau: Nuclear v&agrave; Renewables tăng; Thermal giảm; Hydroelectric dao động ổn định</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jektdtz6qoRvzfxDwTGl0Vy3g8d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Nuclear tăng mạnh nhất v&agrave; trở th&agrave;nh nguồn chiếm ưu thế; Thermal giảm đ&aacute;ng kể d&ugrave; ghi nhận số liệu cao nhất ban đầu.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pi8FdlqEUoy6aGxXSiglpGrIgeh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Nuclear v&agrave; Thermal</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IrAwd9JxtorDimxNXDOlx9MTgjb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mv4ydageCozWmrxlQq1lediYgyh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1980&nbsp;</strong><em>(Thermal dẫn đầu với 120 TW-h, gần gấp đ&ocirc;i so với Nuclear ở mức 65 TW-h)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZtjIdTLXno4SoPxSdvYlmqRJgjb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Nuclear </strong><em>(tăng đều, đạt đỉnh 430 TW-h v&agrave;o năm 2005, sau đ&oacute; giảm nhẹ xuống 405 TW-h v&agrave;o năm 2012</em><em>).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WAqKdWGlYoOAo0ximCrlWu3ZgE2\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Thermal </strong><em>(Giảm mạnh xuống mức thấp nhất 35 TW-h v&agrave;o năm 1993, sau đ&oacute; phục hồi nhẹ v&agrave; dao động trong khoảng 40-58 TW-h, trước khi kết th&uacute;c ở mức 42 TW-h)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TjNPd6TvCoVV5Hxq9TQlhCehgNb\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TjNPd6TvCoVV5Hxq9TQlhCehgNb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BbzKdPgEyoLpsjx7kYIlQ0Q1g4g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S0l8dkGHhoeVf1xdcuPlhdbRgHd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YFozdR2IuosAukxF4wqlDPA0gnh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Hydroelectric v&agrave; Renewables</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZFQdbZvYoA2RXxrWTdlYAEJgtc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OakHdjIq4oN7KmxKkddlvVE7gKx\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1980 </strong><em>(Hydroelectric bắt đầu ở mức 70 TW-h tương tự Nuclear; Renewables gần như bằng 0)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V4tJdLPfloxVJRxsTf8lJMu0gqe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Hydroelectric </strong><em>(dao động trong khoảng 48-78 TW-h suốt giai đoạn, sau c&ugrave;ng đạt mức 55 TW-h năm 2012)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yj1MdLcoSo9tuGxcCjRl7N4QgSg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Renewables </strong><em>(gần như kh&ocirc;ng đ&aacute;ng kể cho đến khoảng 2008, sau đ&oacute; tăng mạnh, đạt 25 TW-h v&agrave;o cuối giai đoạn)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RuxRdF0GuoF09YxnotEl2yn7gbj\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgpOdgFa5orVtdxiKOPliFF8gih\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RYRddABRToQrqNxG0fSl7OrOg5c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YdvRdtEEMoe1nqxSg4NlhL6GgQf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WIUnd6WAUoXWJSx4xA3lyHevgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GzVudZspKo0jPLxbMunl1LTAgjc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>lượng điện sản xuất\"</strong>, thay v&igrave; d&ugrave;ng \"<strong>electricity production\"</strong>, m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể paraphrase th&agrave;nh \"<strong>the amount of electricity generated</strong>\" để đa dạng c&acirc;u từ hơn nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TuK9dgT5AoBU6KxgM0plA894gId\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NvYsd4I6NoNXSxxNnTolfHG5gee\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The line graph illustrates <strong>the amount of electricity generated</strong> from four different sources in France over a 32-year period, from 1980 to 2012.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2756,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AdXQdVSrAontIgx76xulQffEgrg\">The line graph illustrates the amount of electricity generated from four different sources in France over a 32-year period, from 1980 to 2012.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 36010,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2757,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, while nuclear power experienced a dramatic surge to become the dominant energy source, thermal power declined considerably despite recording the highest figure at the beginning. In addition, hydroelectric power fluctuated within a narrow range, and renewables only began to show notable growth towards the end of the period.</p>",
            "question_id": 36010,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2758,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Looking at the two sources with the most significant changes, in 1980, thermal power was the leading source of electricity at 120 TW-h, nearly double that of nuclear power, which stood at 65 TW-h. However, nuclear energy subsequently experienced a remarkable rise, climbing steadily to reach a peak of 430 TW-h in 2005, before dropping slightly to 405 TW-h in 2012. In contrast, thermal power saw a sharp decline, falling to a low of just 35 TW-h by 1993. It then recovered slightly, fluctuating between 40 and 58 TW-h, and ended the period at 42 TW-h.</p>",
            "question_id": 36010,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2759,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p>Regarding the other two energy sources, hydroelectric power started at 70 TW-h in 1980, a figure similar to that of nuclear power at the time, while virtually no renewable electricity was produced that year. Throughout the period, hydroelectric power fluctuated within a range of 48 to 78 TW-h, before ending at 55 TW-h in the final year. Renewables, on the other hand, remained negligible until around 2008, after which they increased noticeably, reaching 25 TW-h by the end of the period.</p>",
            "question_id": 36010,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
